{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 47,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        126.61820220947266,
        27.289522171020508,
        326.90234375,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "5. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS ON THE NEWBORN CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.1129455566406,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "defined as the combination of continuous skin-to-skin contact, support for exclusive",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        399.08294677734375,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "breastfeeding or other appropriate feeding and early recognition, and response to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        85.74208068847656,
        399.0929260253906,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "complications. Studies where KMC was only commenced after the first week of life",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        98.74208068847656,
        399.0528869628906,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "were excluded. Measured outcomes were neonatal mortality due to complications of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        111.74208068847656,
        263.5329284667969,
        125.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "preterm birth, or morbidity related to prematurity.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        124.74208068847656,
        399.13134765625,
        138.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "The review included 15 studies: nine randomized controlled trials (RCT), and six",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        137.74208068847656,
        399.1328430175781,
        151.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "observational studies. All studies were from low or middle-income countries. Of the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        150.74208068847656,
        399.01287841796875,
        164.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "RCTs, six reported mortality data, but only three were included in the analysis. Two",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        163.7421112060547,
        399.1228332519531,
        177.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "studies were excluded because median time of initiation of KMC was greater than",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        176.7421112060547,
        399.0328674316406,
        190.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "1 week after birth, and the third study – a community trial from Bangladesh – was",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        189.7421112060547,
        399.1129455566406,
        203.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "thought to have important methodological limitations and was not conducted in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        202.7421112060547,
        399.0528259277344,
        216.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "health facilities. Analysis of the three remaining trials – from India, Colombia and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        215.7421112060547,
        399.07257080078125,
        229.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "Ethiopia – showed a major mortality reduction with KMC for babies < 2000 g (RR",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        300.2452087402344,
        228.52210998535156,
        391.51513671875,
        242.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "see GRADE table A7.6",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        228.7421112060547,
        399.1164855957031,
        242.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "0.49, 95% CI 0.29 to 0.82; 988 infants (High quality evidence,  ).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        241.7421112060547,
        399.1414489746094,
        255.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "These mortality results are supported by results from three observational studies",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        254.7421112060547,
        399.0327453613281,
        268.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "(8257 infants) which also showed a mortality reduction (RR 0.68, 95% CI 0.58–0.79),",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        267.7420959472656,
        399.0328063964844,
        281.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "though this was heavily influenced by a large South African study that contributed",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        280.7420959472656,
        222.56295776367188,
        294.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "96% to the weight of the pooled estimate.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        293.7420959472656,
        399.1115417480469,
        307.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "Five RCTs reported data on serious morbidity, defined as severe pneumonia,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        306.7420959472656,
        399.0828857421875,
        320.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "sepsis, jaundice, and other severe illness. There were variations in study definitions",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        319.7420959472656,
        399.0883483886719,
        333.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "and heterogeneity in the results (I  = 70%, P < 0.01). However, KMC was associated  2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        332.7420959472656,
        399.04254150390625,
        346.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "with a reduction in serious neonatal morbidity (RR 0.34; 95% CI 0.17 to 0.65; 1520",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        202.04310607910156,
        345.5220947265625,
        294.5130920410156,
        359.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "see GRADE table A7.6",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        345.7420959472656,
        302.1160888671875,
        359.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "babies. (Moderate quality evidence,  ).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        370.2607116699219,
        163.96286010742188,
        382.2507019042969
      ],
      "text": "5.8.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        385.9053955078125,
        88.77290344238281,
        398.0453796386719
      ],
      "text": "Benefits",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        398.9153747558594,
        399.04290771484375,
        412.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "There is high quality evidence that KMC leads to a significant reduction in neonatal",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        411.9153747558594,
        399.1129150390625,
        425.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "mortality, and moderate quality evidence that it reduces serious morbidity, when",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        424.9154052734375,
        399.1128234863281,
        438.4054260253906
      ],
      "text": "compared to conventional care for babies < 2000 grams in low- to middle-income",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        437.9154052734375,
        332.452880859375,
        451.4054260253906
      ],
      "text": "countries. Other benefits were seen with breastfeeding and bonding.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        459.4093017578125,
        78.65290069580078,
        471.5492858886719
      ],
      "text": "Risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        472.4192810058594,
        399.04278564453125,
        485.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "Possible risks include apnoea and bradycardia in some babies. It should be noted that",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        485.4192810058594,
        323.32293701171875,
        498.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "KMC should be started once the LBW infants are clinically stable.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        509.9378967285156,
        205.31298828125,
        521.9279174804688
      ],
      "text": "5.8.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        525.5924682617188,
        399.11285400390625,
        539.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "The benefits would be highly valued by families, health providers and programme",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        538.5924682617188,
        399.1229553222656,
        552.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "managers/policy makers. Additional costs for training health workers and counseling",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        551.5924682617188,
        399.0729675292969,
        565.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "mothers and families in KMC would be offset by the cost for conventional care (i.e.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        564.5924682617188,
        130.6029052734375,
        578.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "use of incubators).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.37319946289062,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.67120361328125,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "33",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}